-#
-#  The person's bank account for the direct debit: the same fields under
-#  "SEPA" on the person's page (people/_finance, with "Einmalzahlung?" above
-#  them) and under "Kontoverbindung" on their Beitrag page
-#  (person/fee/_bank_account). Below them a mail to the finance team to ask
-#  for a change (WsjRdp2027::PeopleHelper#sepa_account_change_mail_to).
-#
-#  Locals: person
= render_attrs(person,
    :sepa_name,
    :sepa_address,
    :sepa_mail,
    :sepa_iban,
    :sepa_bic,
    :sepa_mandate_id,
    :sepa_mandate_date)
%p.mt-2= sepa_account_change_mail_to(person)
